OpenEGCS / liftsim
==================

This program is a modified version of liftsim, written in 2011 by Nivvedan
and Ankush Das as a course project for CS 293 (Data Structures and Algorithms
Lab) at IIT Bombay, and published at https://github.com/nivvedan/liftsim under
the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later
version.

Modifications
-------------
Since 2026 Bernardo Fioreze has modified liftsim extensively. The original
program simulated a group of elevators with a fixed dispatch rule; this version
turns it into a discrete-event platform for benchmarking elevator dispatch
algorithms: pluggable dispatch, group dispatch, route ordering, traffic,
passenger behaviour, stop duration, travel time and metrics; a jerk-limited
kinematic travel model and an electromechanical energy model; cabin capacity;
deterministic seeded runs; a JSON snapshot of every run; reference
implementations of published dispatch algorithms and the benches that run
them; and a test suite.

Files that carry the original 2011 header are derived from the original
liftsim and keep its copyright notice; each says it was modified. All other
files are new in this version, Copyright (C) 2026 Bernardo Fioreze.

